{"unit":5,"no":20,"title":"Buying things","blurb":"Unit 5","VOCAB":[["size","","размер","өлшем",""],["fit","","сидеть (по размеру)","шақ келу",""],["changing room","","примерочная","киім өлшейтін бөлме",""],["receipt","","чек","чек",""],["discount","","скидка","жеңілдік",""],["sale","","распродажа","жеңілдік науқаны",""],["cash","","наличные","қолма-қол ақша",""],["card","","карта","карта",""],["comfortable","","удобный","ыңғайлы",""],["useful","","полезный","пайдалы",""],["value for money","","стоит своих денег","ақшасына тұрарлық",""],["I'm just looking","","я просто смотрю","жай қарап жүрмін",""],["try on","","примерить","өлшеп көру",""]],"SLIDES":[["🛍️","She shops quickly."]],"PICWORDS":["size","fit","changing room","receipt","discount","sale","cash","card","comfortable","useful","value for money","I'm just looking","try on"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"5_15":"A1_L20_5_15.mp3","5_16":"A1_L20_5_16.mp3","5_17":"A1_L20_5_17.mp3"},"SEGS":{"5_15":[3.7,null],"5_16":[4.03,null],"5_17":[3.8,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>Buying things</h2>\n      <p>Buy something in a shop: ask about size and price — and give your opinion on a product.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes, top to bottom.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">You in a shop — which one is you?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap one. Be honest!</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>🏃</b> &nbsp;in and out in two minutes</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🔍</b> &nbsp;I compare everything</div><div class=\"card\"><b>💬</b> &nbsp;“I'm just looking…” (for an hour)</div><div class=\"card\"><b>💳</b> &nbsp;I buy first, think later</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">These are your shop words for this lesson.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Choose the correct word.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s3SSt1\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">These jeans don't ___ — I need a bigger size.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">fit</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">try</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">receipt</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">You can try clothes on in the ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">receipt</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">value for money</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">changing room</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Students get a 20% ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sale</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fit</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">discount</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Keep the ___ — maybe you need to return it.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">receipt</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">cash</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">fit</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">You can pay by ___ or in cash.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">size</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">card</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">fit</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">Good quality and a low price = great ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">value for money</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">changing room</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">receipt</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>fit · changing room · discount · receipt · card · value for money.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Match each word to its meaning.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Tap a word, then tap the meaning.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\"><b>Word</b> &rarr; <b>Meaning</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s3GRt3\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>discount</b> <select data-answer=\"you pay less\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>receipt</b> <select data-answer=\"the paper after you pay\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>changing room</b> <select data-answer=\"you try clothes on here\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>sale</b> <select data-answer=\"everything is cheaper\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>cash</b> <select data-answer=\"paper money and coins\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>fit</b> <select data-answer=\"the right size for you\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Match each word to its meaning.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Tap a word, then tap the meaning.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\"><b>Word</b> &rarr; <b>Meaning</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s3OOt5\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>discount</b> <select data-answer=\"you pay less\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>receipt</b> <select data-answer=\"the paper after you pay\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>changing room</b> <select data-answer=\"you try clothes on here\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>sale</b> <select data-answer=\"everything is cheaper\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>cash</b> <select data-answer=\"paper money and coins\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>fit</b> <select data-answer=\"the right size for you\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you pay less\">you pay less</option><option value=\"the paper after you pay\">the paper after you pay</option><option value=\"you try clothes on here\">you try clothes on here</option><option value=\"everything is cheaper\">everything is cheaper</option><option value=\"paper money and coins\">paper money and coins</option><option value=\"the right size for you\">the right size for you</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Adjectives describe things. Adverbs describe actions.</div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('5_15',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 5.15 — seven mini dialogues</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 How much money do you earn? — Not much, so I try to spend it carefully. 2 Why do you look so scared? — Because you're driving dangerously! 3 Why are you talking so quietly? — Shhh! We're in the library! 4 I always get up late at weekends. — Me too. 5 I can't see the television clearly. — I think you need glasses. 6 Maria answers every question correctly. — She's the best student. 7 Did you do well in your exam? — I got an A.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s4t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">He tries to spend his money ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">quickly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">carefully</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">dangerously</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“You're driving ___!”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">quietly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">carefully</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">dangerously</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">“Why are you talking so ___?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">quietly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">clearly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">carefully</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">“Did you do ___ in your exam?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">goodly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">carefully</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">well</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>carefully · dangerously · quietly · <b>well</b> — good has no -ly.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“She is a <b>careful</b> shopper.” → “She spends her money <b>carefully</b>.”</div><div>“He is a <b>dangerous</b> driver.” → “He drives <b>dangerously</b>.”</div><div>“Maria's answers are <b>correct</b>.” → “She answers every question <b>correctly</b>.”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> what do we add to the adjective to describe the ACTION?</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th>Adjective — the thing</th><th>Adverb — the action</th><th>Example</th></tr><tr><td>quick</td><td class=\"pos\">quickly</td><td>She pays <b>quickly</b>.</td></tr><tr><td>careful</td><td class=\"pos\">carefully</td><td>Spend your money <b>carefully</b>.</td></tr><tr><td>dangerous</td><td class=\"pos\">dangerously</td><td>You're driving <b>dangerously</b>!</td></tr><tr><td>quiet</td><td class=\"pos\">quietly</td><td>Why are you talking so <b>quietly</b>?</td></tr><tr><td>good</td><td class=\"pos\"><b>well</b> (irregular!)</td><td>Did you do <b>well</b> in your exam?</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">really / quite / very + adjective: <b>really</b> comfortable · <b>quite</b> cheap · <b>very</b> useful</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>Adjective + <b>-ly</b> = adverb: quick → quick<b>ly</b>, careful → careful<b>ly</b>.</div><div>One big exception: good → <b>well</b>. “She sings well” (not “goodly”!).</div><div>Make adjectives stronger or softer: <b>really</b> comfortable · <b>very</b> useful · <b>quite</b> cheap.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Practice\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Practice</div>\n      <h2>Practice</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 — Adjective or adverb?</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s5t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She's a ___ driver.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">carefully</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">careful</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">carefull</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She drives ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">careful</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">carefully</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">carefull</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">This sofa is really ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">comfortably</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">careful</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">comfortable</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He speaks very ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">quietly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">quiet</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">careful</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">These trainers fit ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">good</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">careful</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">well</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">It's ___ cheap — only 990 tenge!\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">carefully</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">careful</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">really</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Thing → adjective (careful driver, comfortable sofa). Action → adverb (drives carefully, fits well).</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s5t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “He drives very careful.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">He drives very carefull.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">He drives very carefulls.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">He drives very carefully.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “She sings goodly.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">She sings good.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">She sings well.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">She sings wells.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “These boots are really comfortably.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">These boots fit really comfortable.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">These boots are really comfortable.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">These boots is really comfortable.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>drives careful<b>ly</b> · sings <b>well</b> · the boots ARE comfortable (adjective after be).</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ I try this on, please?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">looking</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">No, thanks. I'm just ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">looking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">look</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Can</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ you like a bag?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Would</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Can I try this on · I'm just look<b>ing</b> · <b>Would</b> you like a bag?</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Listen\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Listen</div>\n      <h2>Listen</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Three little scenes in a shop.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then choose the correct answers.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('5_16',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 5.16 — at the till</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 — C: Excuse me? How much is this magazine? A: It's £4.99. C: And do you offer a student discount? A: Yes, we do. You get 20% off. C: Do you sell batteries? A: Yes — what kind do you need? C: AA, please. Just one packet. — 2 — A: Can I help you? C: No, thanks. I'm just looking. A: If you need anything, just ask. C: Can I try this hoodie on, please? A: Yes, of course. The changing rooms are over there. — 3 — C: Two egg and tomato sandwiches and two coffees. A: That's £10.98, please. C: Can I pay by card? A: No, I'm afraid we only take cash. C: OK. A: Would you like a bag? C: Yes, please — just a small one. A: And would you like a receipt? C: Yes, please. Just put it in the bag.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How much is the magazine?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">£10.98</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">£4.99</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">£20</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">How big is the student discount?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">10%</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">50%</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">20%</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">What does the customer want to try on?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">A suit</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Boots</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">A hoodie</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Can the customer pay by card in scene 3?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Yes, of course</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">£4.99</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">No — cash only</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">What goes in the bag at the end?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">The receipt</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The batteries</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">The magazine</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>£4.99 · 20% off · a hoodie → the changing rooms · cash only · “Just put the receipt in the bag.”</p></div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('5_17',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 5.17 — nine shop questions</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 Can I help you? — No, thanks. I'm just looking. 2 Do you need a bag? — Yes, please. Just a small one. 3 Can I try this on, please? — Of course. The changing rooms are over there. 4 Can I pay by card? — No, I'm afraid we only take cash. 5 How much is this magazine? — It's £4.99. 6 Do you offer a student discount? — Yes, we do. You get 20% off. 7 Would you like a receipt? — Yes, please. 8 Do you sell batteries? — Yes, we do. 9 What time do you close? — At eight o'clock.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s6t6\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">“Can I help you?” —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Yes, we do.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">No, thanks. I'm just looking.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">No, thanks. I just looking.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“Can I try this on?” —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">No, I'm afraid we only take cash.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Of course. The changing rooms is over there.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Of course. The changing rooms are over there.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">“What time do you close?” —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">It's £4.99.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">At eight o'clock.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">It've £4.99.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>I'm just looking · the changing rooms are over there · at eight o'clock.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write your own shop dialogue.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">6–8 lines: ask the price, ask about a discount, try something on, pay.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>How much is this…?</li><li>Can I try this on?</li><li>Do you offer a student discount?</li><li>Can I pay by card?</li><li>It fits really well!</li><li>Would you like a receipt?</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">The shop. One customer, one assistant. Then swap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">The customer has three jobs: price, discount, try on.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>How much is this…?</li><li>Can I try this on?</li><li>Do you offer a discount?</li><li>I'm afraid…</li><li>It fits really well!</li><li>Would you like a receipt?</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">The shop. One customer, one assistant. Then swap roles.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">The customer has three jobs: price, discount, try on.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>How much is this…?</li><li>Can I try this on?</li><li>Do you offer a discount?</li><li>I'm afraid…</li><li>It fits really well!</li><li>Would you like a receipt?</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Round 1</b> — Student A is the customer: choose a thing to buy (a jacket, trainers, a gift). Ask the price, ask for a discount, try it on, pay. Student B is the assistant — say no to ONE request politely.</div><div><b>Round 2</b> — swap roles and change the shop.</div><div>End every purchase with an opinion: “It fits really well!” / “Great value for money!”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Round 1</b> — Student A is the customer: choose a thing to buy (a jacket, trainers, a gift). Ask the price, ask for a discount, try it on, pay. Student B is the assistant — say no to ONE request politely.</div><div><b>Round 2</b> — swap roles and change the shop.</div><div>End every purchase with an opinion: “It fits really well!” / “Great value for money!”</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s8t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ is this jumper?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"much\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Can I ___ it on?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"try\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Do you have it in a bigger ___?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"size\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>How much is\\u2026? \\u00b7 try it on \\u00b7 these + plural \\u00b7 pay by card.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s8t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How many is it?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How much is it?\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Can I to try it on?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Can I try it on?\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">This shoes are nice.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"These shoes are nice.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>How much is\\u2026? \\u00b7 try it on \\u00b7 these + plural \\u00b7 pay by card.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l20s8t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Ask the price of the scarf.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How much is the scarf?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Ask to pay by card.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Can I pay by card?|Could I pay by card?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Ask for size medium.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Do you have it in medium?|Have you got it in medium?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>How much is\\u2026? \\u00b7 try it on \\u00b7 these + plural \\u00b7 pay by card.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}